      "text": "The number of active users U of an online service changes at a rate proportional to U, where t is measured in months. At \\( t = 0 \\), \\( U = 560 \\) users, and at \\( t = 4 \\), \\( U = 2240 \\) users. Find an expression for \\( U(t) \\).",
